  "jobTitle": "Software Engineer III",
  "summary": "As a software engineer at Stream Engine, I leverage my skills and knowledge in Google Kubernetes Engine (GKE), AWS CodePipeline, and AWS CodeDeploy to build and deploy scalable and reliable applications for various clients. I have been working at Stream Engine for over two years, and I enjoy collaborating with a diverse and talented team of engineers and designers who share a passion for creating innovative solutions. Before joining Stream Engine, I worked as a software engineer at SmartBot360, where I developed and maintained chatbot platforms for different industries, such as healthcare, education, and e-commerce. I have a bachelor's degree in computer science from the University of California, Riverside, where I learned the fundamentals of programming, data structures, algorithms, and software engineering. I am always eager to learn new technologies and tools, and to improve my coding and problem-solving skills. My goal is to use my expertise and experience to deliver high-quality software that meets the needs and expectations of the users and the clients.",
